[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Nested File
Comment=A DIFFERENT application that derives to the SAME desktop ID,
Comment[x-note]=vendor-app.desktop, because the FreeDesktop scheme replaces the
Comment[x-note2]=directory separator with a dash and dashes are not escaped.
Comment[x-note3]=Observed for real on the capture host. See CHECKLIST.md OPEN-2.
Exec=/usr/bin/nested-file
Icon=nested-file
Terminal=false
